<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire seven-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:48 GMT]</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire seven-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:48 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>(Corrects payment frequency to semi-annual from quarterly)</p>
<p> NOTES	ANY COUPON FIX WILL NOT BE MORE THAN 40 B.P. ABOVE</p>
<p>		PRIOR FIX. CAPPED AT 10 PERCENT.</p>
<p>		ISSUED IN ITALIAN DOMESTIC MARKET.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
